<title>
DTC P0717 / P1738 / P1739
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5104027001">
<title>
DTC Detecting Condition and Trouble Area
</title>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "4.190in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "3.011in"/>
<thead>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
DTC detecting condition
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
Trouble area
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P0717: Input / Turbine Speed Sensor “A” Circuit No Signal
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Input shaft speed sensor signal is not input even if output shaft speed sensor signal is input.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" morerows = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Input shaft speed sensor
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Solenoid harness with ATF temperature sensor
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
TCM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "1">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P1738: Input / Turbine Speed Sensor “A” Circuit Low
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Input shaft speed sensor signal circuit is open or shorted to ground.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph etype = "bold">
P1739: Input / Turbine Speed Sensor “A” Circuit High
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Input shaft speed sensor signal circuit is shorted to power supply.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(1 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</servinfosub>
