<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5104027003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A5104027004">
<title>
P0717
</title>
<attention1>
<ptxt>
If you do not select a suitable route and take proper precautions when performing a road test, an accident can occur.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Select a level road with no traffic to minimize the risk of accident.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the test extremely carefully.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the road test with 2 persons, a driver and a tester.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Limit the driving speed permissible in road conditions and regulations.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that the following condition is met in this “DTC Confirmation Procedure”.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
DTC U0073 or U0100 is not detected.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drive vehicle at approx. 30 km/h (19 mile/h) for a total of 5 minutes.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A5104027005">
<title>
P1738 / P1739
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Set ignition “ON” for 10 sec.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5104027006">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLSB0A5104027007">
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A5104027008">
<question>
Was “A/T Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A5104001">A/T Control System Check</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A5104027009">
<title>
Scan tool parameter check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Warm up engine to normal operating temperature.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Drive vehicle.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check “Engine Speed” and “Input Shaft Revolution” using “Data list” mode on SUZUKI scan tool. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5104008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check that “Input Shaft Revolution” varies depending on “Engine Speed”.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Check for intermittent trouble. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A0006002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A5104027010">
<title>
Solenoid harness check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Remove TCM. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Remove valve body assembly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect input shaft speed sensor connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check for proper terminal connections to solenoid harness connector and input shaft speed sensor connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
If connections are OK, check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance of “A1” and “A2” circuits: less than 1 &#937;
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between each of “A1” and “A2” circuits and ground: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “A1” circuit terminal and other terminal at solenoid harness connector: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “A2” circuit terminal and other terminal at solenoid harness connector: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Voltage of “A1” and “A2” circuits: approx. 0 V (When ignition is “ON”)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace solenoid harness with ATF temperature sensor. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106040"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLSB0A5104027011">
<title>
Input shaft speed sensor check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check input shaft speed sensor. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106039"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Substitute a known-good TCM and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace input shaft speed sensor. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106038"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
